                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A willow native to Europe and western Asia (Salix alba)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a16be20-9285-43ad-b45f-8ffec6144539",
                                                "sense_id": "1cff6f6c-5bd1-356e-91ac-2ba3476d86dd",
                                                "text": "Here, Tess interjected. Follow me, and she took them to a clearing filled with willow: I think these are white willows and by spring they will flourish, don’t they look kind of feminine? The male and female flowers grow on separate trees."
                                            }
